# Public browser origins only; no credentials. Existing explicit env overrides
# binary defaults, so the service owner must merge this key into its loaded
# environment (preserving other settings) and restart only ynx-faucetd.
YNX_FAUCET_ALLOWED_ORIGINS=https://ynxweb4.com,https://www.ynxweb4.com,https://wallet.ynxweb4.com,https://faucet-testnet.ynxweb4.com,https://faucet.ynxweb4.com
